title: Publishing Reusable AI/ML Models in the Life Sciences (MAQC2026 Tutorial P06)
message: If you use or adapt this tutorial, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Gavin
    family-names: Farrell
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0558-8337
    affiliation: BioComputingUP, University of Padua
repository-code: https://github.com/gavinf97/dome-tutorial-maqc-2026
url: https://gavinf97.github.io/dome-tutorial-maqc-2026/
abstract: >-
  Tutorial companion site for MAQC2026 Technical Tutorial P06, "Publishing
  Reusable AI/ML Models in the Life Sciences", held on 23 September 2026 in
  Brescia, Italy. Covers the DOME recommendations for reporting supervised
  machine learning in biology, the DOME Registry, DOME Copilot, the Open and
  Sustainable AI (OSAI) recommendations, and three practical routes to
  producing a DOME transparency report.
keywords:
  - DOME
  - OSAI
  - machine learning
  - reporting standards
  - transparency
  - reproducibility
  - FAIR
  - ELIXIR
  - MAQC
